  "painter_dropped": {
    "flick-lit-fur": "The pale flicks on the lit edge are the same measured color as the grayer white of the white patches (no lighter gray than the silver fur is left: paints --add cat refused one 7.6 from the mid gray), so they arrive with the white patches and a pass here would add nothing.",
    "shade-the-cat": "The finish has no shadow gray on the cat: paints --add cat finds no color darker than the mid fur gray except the stripes' charcoal, so a shading pass would either show nothing or lay every stripe at once; the shadow side is the stripes set closer together, and it arrives with the stripes."
  },
